    "upload_description_plain": "It's the Statin Skank:\r\n\r\nI was experimenting and exploring vital vst (a freeware vst) to see what sounds it is capable of making. I made some physical modeled sounds with it. Hammond, analog bass drum, snare drums, conga's, bongo's, guitar, some brass, timbales etc. All instrument and sound exept from the vocals are from vital synth. Now i'm not the best in physical modeling, but IMO the synth is capable of getting quite near to real sounding sounds.\r\n\r\nWhile working on it i wanted to hear what my try out track sounded like with some vocals and i took by chance the vocals from it's the statin skank, to see where i had to change something in the chords and rearange things to fit eachother. But, to speak with Bob Ross, happy incidents occur, and it fitted right in.\r\n\r\nThe lyrics are realy fun, and with the subject of a skank, it fits right into the rocksteady/ska like track i have made.\r\n\r\nSo here is what i have made of it, some sounds could have been done better, but i wanted to stick to vital for the sounds only, so that is intentional.\r\n\r\nMaybe someone likes the sounds and is interested in presets from the sounds, just let me know and i will arrange something for you.\r\n\r\nHave fun with it.\r\n\r\ngreetz, Frank",
    "upload_description_html": "It&#8217;s the Statin Skank:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI was experimenting and exploring vital vst (a freeware vst) to see what sounds it is capable of making. I made some physical modeled sounds with it. Hammond, analog bass drum, snare drums, conga&#8217;s, bongo&#8217;s, guitar, some brass, timbales etc. All instrument and sound exept from the vocals are from vital synth. Now i&#8217;m not the best in physical modeling, but IMO the synth is capable of getting quite near to real sounding sounds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile working on it i wanted to hear what my try out track sounded like with some vocals and i took by chance the vocals from it&#8217;s the statin skank, to see where i had to change something in the chords and rearange things to fit eachother. But, to speak with Bob Ross, happy incidents occur, and it fitted right in.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe lyrics are realy fun, and with the subject of a skank, it fits right into the rocksteady/ska like track i have made.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo here is what i have made of it, some sounds could have been done better, but i wanted to stick to vital for the sounds only, so that is intentional.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaybe someone likes the sounds and is interested in presets from the sounds, just let me know and i will arrange something for you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun with it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\ngreetz, Frank"
  },
